---
import projects from "../../data/projects.json";
import { ACTION_LABELS } from "./studioState";
import "./studio.css";
const links = projects.flatMap(project => project.links.map(link => ({ ...link, title: project.title })));
---
<div class="studio" data-studio data-state="room">
  <div class="studio-scene" data-studio-scene aria-label="可交互的三维工作室">
    <p class="studio-loading" data-studio-status role="status">正在布置工作室…</p>
    <span class="studio-tooltip" data-studio-tooltip hidden></span>
  </div>
  <p class="studio-signature">JUSTIN / PERSONAL SPACE</p>
  <nav class="studio-access" aria-label="工作室无障碍入口">
    {Object.entries(ACTION_LABELS).map(([action, label]) => <button data-studio-action={action}>{label}</button>)}
  </nav>
</div>
<dialog class="studio-dialog" data-studio-dialog aria-labelledby="studio-panel-title">
  <button class="studio-close" aria-label="关闭面板" autofocus>✕</button>
  <p class="studio-eyebrow">A LITTLE ABOUT MY WORLD</p>
  <h2 id="studio-panel-title"></h2>
  <section data-studio-panel="about" hidden>
    <p>这里是 Justin 的个人工作室，用来展示正在制作的工具与项目。</p>
    {projects.map(project => <article><h3>{project.title}</h3><p>{project.summary}</p></article>)}
    <p class="studio-muted">完整简历尚未提供。</p>
  </section>
  <section data-studio-panel="contact" hidden>
    <p>可以从这些公开项目继续了解我的工作。</p>
    {links.map(link => <a class="studio-public-link" href={link.href} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{link.title} · {link.label}<span>↗</span></a>)}
    <p class="studio-muted">邮箱与其他联系方式尚未公开。</p>
  </section>
</dialog>
